  "body": "Enjoy effortless coastal living from this beautifully maintained, single-level modern duplex, superbly positioned in one of Kensington Park's more elevated and premium locations.\r\n\r\nNorth-facing and filled with natural light, the home offers a stylish, low-maintenance lifestyle with a spacious open-plan living area designed to capture the outlook. From its elevated position, enjoy panoramic views across beautifully landscaped gardens, the tranquil native bush reserve and out towards the sparkling sea.\r\n\r\nFeaturing:\r\n2 spacious bedrooms\r\n2 elegant bathrooms\r\nSingle-car garage\r\nGenerous open-plan living and dining\r\nNorth-facing aspect with abundant natural light\r\nElevated outlook across gardens, native bush and sea\r\nModern finishes throughout\r\nFreehold strata title\r\n\r\nLife at Kensington Park is about more than just your home. Residents enjoy access to an impressive range of shared amenities including a heated indoor pool, gym, sauna, garden café and beautifully landscaped grounds.\r\n\r\nWhether you're downsizing, looking for a peaceful coastal retreat, or simply want the freedom to lock up and leave, this is a home that makes everyday living feel like a holiday.",
